  "2026-09-08T16:13:02.051Z","harness:codex","Dependency eligibility verified against installed pnpm 11.10 source: default minimum-release-age is 24*60 minutes. typescript-eslint 8.70.0 published 2026-09-07T18:18Z remains inside that window at the afternoon verification; no exclusion or bypass added. TypeScript 7 remains outside the currently supported typescript-eslint range. Current pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities across 436 dependencies."
