  "2026-09-10T18:23:47.301Z","harness:codex","Live 2026-09-10 evening registry check: @codspeed/vitest-plugin 5.7.1 still declares Vitest ^3.2 || ^4. The Vitest 5 and coverage-v8 5 pair remains outside the mandatory performance harness peer range. Retain this canonical unclaimed migration; no peer override added."
